OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1787080720
OL,3,CHundreds of fish die after fire foam
OL,4,Cpollutes river
OL,6,FHundreds of fish have been found dead
OL,7,Fafter a fire at an industrial unit
OL,8,Fcaused masses of foam to run into a
OL,9,Friver.
OL,11,FThe fish were discovered in the River
OL,12,FTame, in Greater Manchester, following
OL,13,Fthe blaze off Wellington Road in
OL,14,FGreenfield, near Saddleworth, on
OL,15,FSunday, 16 August, according to the
OL,16,FEnvironment Agency.
OL,18,FA spokesperson said: "Environment
OL,19,FOfficers and Fisheries Officers
OL,20,Fattended the site and met with Greater
OL,21,FManchester Fire and Rescue Service.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
