OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1787080720
OL,3,CHundreds of fish die after fire foam
OL,4,Cpollutes river
OL,6,F"Containment booms had been deployed;
OL,7,Fhowever, some fire water runoff had
OL,8,Fentered the River Tame. During the
OL,9,Finitial site visit, officers recorded
OL,10,Fseveral hundred dead fish in the
OL,11,Faffected area."
OL,13,FFisheries officers have since re-
OL,14,Finspected the river to assess the
OL,15,Fongoing impact of the pollution.
OL,17,FThe spokesperson continued: "Fisheries
OL,18,FOfficers returned to the site and
OL,19,Fconfirmed that no additional fish
OL,20,Ffatalities have been identified.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,367,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1787080720
OL,3,CHundreds of fish die after fire foam
OL,4,Cpollutes river
OL,6,F"Foam remains visible on the river,
OL,7,Fparticularly around weirs where the
OL,8,Fwater is more turbulent. However,
OL,9,Fobservations indicate that the foam is
OL,10,Fdispersing downstream after passing
OL,11,Fover the weirs.
OL,13,F"The Environment Agency will continue
OL,14,Fto monitor the situation to assess any
OL,15,Fongoing environmental impacts, and
OL,16,Fdetermine next steps."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
