PN,36604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1787080720
OL,3,CHundreds of fish die after fire foam
OL,4,Cpollutes river
OL,6,FThe fire caused immediate safety
OL,7,Fconcerns for nearby households on
OL,8,FSunday, 16 August, with the fire
OL,9,Fservice advising local residents to
OL,10,Fkeep their windows and doors closed.
OL,12,FAround 45 homes were evacuated due to
OL,13,Fthe blaze, though the latest update
OL,14,Ffrom the fire service confirms that
OL,15,Fresidents have since been allowed to
OL,16,Freturn to their properties.
OL,18,FSince the incident, several concerned
OL,19,Fresidents have shared images of the
OL,20,FRiver Tame showing large patches of
OL,21,Ffoam on the surface of the water.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5
